  triage:closedAt "2026-09-05T09:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:closedBy "quality-mgr" ;
  triage:triageRecordVersion "2" .

# CLOSURE (qa-pr1196-r1, quality-mgr): PR #1196 at d9ef17ca3 corrects
# docs/plans/phase-aw/sprint-AW.5-native-tool-parity.md:61-62 to read "The
# test lives in crates/atm-graft-python/tests/test_cli_parity.py and runs in
# CI's platform test job on Python 3.14.7. The abi3 compatibility matrix
# independently validates wheel imports on Python 3.11-3.14." quality-mgr
# independently re-read the corrected doc text against .github/workflows/ci.yml
# and confirmed it now accurately describes the actual CI scope (single-version
# test job for the parity test; separate abi3-compat matrix job for wheel
# import validation only, never running test_cli_parity.py). req-qa
# independently confirmed the same this round. This closes the doc-vs-CI
# scope mismatch this finding was filed for.

